    "system": {
        "type": "basic",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 5–10 bx; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.5 lb.;</p><p>Street toughs and enforcers in Scadrial’s big cities love using knucklebones. Brass knuckles are common, but when fighting Allomancers, the more expensive wooden variety is worth every coin.</p><p>You can wear knucklebones on your hand instead of wielding a weapon in that hand. When you make an unarmed attack using that hand, increase the size of each unarmed damage die by one size (see the @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.Rn9IDL3Nvu7wvARP.JournalEntryPage.HOD84joH34YPDpWb]{Unarmed Damage} table earlier in this chapter). For example, damage of 1 (no die roll) becomes 1d4, 1d8 becomes 1d10, and so on.</p>",
